   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "宜家提供一系列衣柜收纳件，比如 KOMPLEMENT 康普蒙 透明塑料托盘分割件。分隔件的九宫格能帮助你整齐收纳配饰，方便拿取。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40246788"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1f/4d/1f4d218db060e50eac9981d6a70210ef.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
